{"id": "P1", "source_run": "seq-r1-20261117-225453", "at": "2026-11-17T23:02:24+0800", "situation": "競爭者網站的 sitemap 有一個佔比很大的單一資料夾，網址是關鍵字當 slug（例如博弈、貸款這類高競爭詞）。要判斷它如何針對指定關鍵字做頁面，並確認 sitemap 的占比能不能代表全站。網域可能曾換過主人或換過主題。", "route": "1. sitemap_tree：用 search 搜指定關鍵字，再用 sample 看最大分區的網址型態，因為 slug 就是對方的關鍵字佈局。\n2. polite_fetch：抓指定關鍵字的專頁和該分區列表頁，因為要看 title、H1、H2、FAQ 與分類結構才能判斷模板化程度。\n3. sitemap_tree：對首頁最新文章網址再搜一次並用 by_month 看 lastmod 截止月份，因為 sitemap 可能漏掉新文，占比不能當全站比例。\n4. wayback：用 timeline 看歷史存檔，再用 snapshot 抓換手前最後的首頁快照，因為註冊日比存檔晚時要確認網域是否換過主題。", "result": "照走", "avoid_reason": "", "paired_id": "", "evidence_ids": ["E-0094", "E-0117", "E-0118", "E-0123", "E-0139", "E-0140", "E-0120", "E-0125"], "route_tools": [{"tool": "sitemap_tree", "domain": null, "path": null, "evidence_ids": ["E-0117"], "call_n": 5}, {"tool": "polite_fetch", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0118"], "call_n": 6}, {"tool": "wayback", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0120"], "call_n": 7}, {"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0118"], "call_n": 8}, {"tool": "polite_fetch", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/3a娛樂城", "evidence_ids": ["E-0123"], "call_n": 9}, {"tool": "wayback", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0125"], "call_n": 11}, {"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/3a娛樂城", "evidence_ids": ["E-0123"], "call_n": 12}, {"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "web.archive.org", "path": "/web/20251108182921id_/https://2030.tw/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0125"], "call_n": 13}, {"tool": "sitemap_tree", "domain": null, "path": null, "evidence_ids": ["E-0139"], "call_n": 20}, {"tool": "sitemap_tree", "domain": null, "path": null, "evidence_ids": ["E-0140"], "call_n": 21}]}
